{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04914","headline":"奉和幸三会寺应制 · 李乂","name":"奉和幸三会寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睿德总无边，神臯择胜缘。\n二仪齐法驾，三会礼香筵。\n汉阙中黄近，秦山太白连。\n台疑观鸟日，池似刻鲸年。\n满月临真境，秋风入御弦。\n小臣叨下列，持管谬窥天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}